WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.181 --> 00:00:02.165
HELENA SHAW
Dad told me you found something.

00:00:02.225 --> 00:00:04.746
A dial that could change
the course of history.

00:00:06.276 --> 00:00:08.276
♪♪

00:00:08.861 --> 00:00:11.055
HARRISON FORD
With Indiana Jones, I always thought

00:00:11.106 --> 00:00:15.587
that what would be interesting,
is to see this educator adventurer

00:00:15.638 --> 00:00:17.971
fooling with the nature of science.

00:00:18.437 --> 00:00:20.690
JAMES MANGOLD
In our movie, the relic is rumored to be

00:00:20.741 --> 00:00:22.200
an invention by Archimedes.

00:00:23.554 --> 00:00:29.343
The research that I found about
the Antikythera, really fueled me.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:39.302
In the cave set, all the things that
Archimedes invented, the lever,

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:45.363
water displacement, all the mathematical
figures are all a part of the design.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:48.148
HARRISON FORD
The story is an intriguing

00:00:48.199 --> 00:00:49.732
intellectual puzzle.

00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:51.513
JÜRGEN VOLLER
Doctor Jones. Get him.

00:00:52.577 --> 00:00:55.274
HARRISON FORD
As well as a physically arduous film.

00:00:55.664 --> 00:00:56.220
RENALDO
Indy!

00:00:56.271 --> 00:00:56.704
HELENA SHAW
Indy!

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:57.609
BASIL SHAW
Indy!

00:00:59.488 --> 00:01:00.934
HARRISON FORD
I always prefer to work on

00:01:00.985 --> 00:01:03.118
a physical set to a virtual set.

00:01:03.413 --> 00:01:06.529
Physical sets bring physical reality.

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.553
KATHLEEN KENNEDY
Harrison wants things to be real.

00:01:09.612 --> 00:01:11.686
JAMES MANGOLD
We spent weeks in Morocco

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:16.155
with these revved up tuk tuks
smashing down the streets of Tangier.

00:01:16.583 --> 00:01:18.450
TEDDY
Turn left! Turn left!

00:01:19.194 --> 00:01:20.448
JAMES MANGOLD
Then Sicily...

00:01:20.499 --> 00:01:21.321
INDIANA JONES
Hang on!

00:01:21.372 --> 00:01:22.155
HELENA SHAW
Indy!

00:01:22.206 --> 00:01:23.825
JAMES MANGOLD
Sicily came to play because

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:27.222
it's where Archimedes lived
basically his whole life.

00:01:27.273 --> 00:01:29.273
♪♪

00:01:30.664 --> 00:01:31.857
JÜRGEN VOLLER
Fasten your seat belts.

00:01:32.624 --> 00:01:34.783
HARRISON FORD
You'll always face the challenge

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:37.969
of bringing something new
and something different.

00:01:38.381 --> 00:01:39.822
PHOEBE WALLER-BRIDGE
There's excitement and danger

00:01:39.873 --> 00:01:42.936
and not knowing what's going to
happen next and the twists and turns...

00:01:42.987 --> 00:01:44.655
it always felt like a real romp.

00:01:46.431 --> 00:01:47.401
INDIANA JONES
Get back!

00:01:47.452 --> 00:01:48.798
INDIANA JONES
You stole it.

00:01:48.849 --> 00:01:49.885
JÜRGEN VOLLER
Then you stole it.

00:01:50.223 --> 00:01:51.195
HELENA SHAW
And then I stole it.

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.043
SALLAH
Give em' hell, Indiana Jones!

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.726
HARRISON FORD
I'm delighted for the audience

00:01:57.777 --> 00:01:59.893
to see this new adventure.

